{# The store's single notice band.

   The theme draws exactly one of these: a dark strip above the header, at the very top of the
   page. There is no second band anywhere — the CMS announcement section feeds this same strip
   rather than adding another one below the navigation — so a visitor sees one line of store news
   in one place, and the header's own announcement slot is this element rather than a copy of it. #}
<div class="notice" role="status" data-storefront-shell-target="announcement">
    <p class="notice-text">{{ text }}</p>
    <button
        class="notice-close"
        type="button"
        aria-label="Duyuruyu kapat"
        data-action="storefront-shell#dismissAnnouncement"
    >×</button>
</div>
